erform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style="display: none">*</td><td/><td><a href="#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-light-treatment-5">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will use her lights MWF after her shower for 3 minutes</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Eve created a chart as a reminer to take the medications that do not fit in her pill box ( @2012-07-23)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class="grid"><tr><td style="display: none">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style="display: none">*</td><td/><td><a href="#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-medication-4">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>In Progress</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-10 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will use a calendar of a chart to help her remember when to take her medications</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><p><b>progress</b>: Will be able to esume exercise. ( @2012-07-30), Eve prefers to focus on walking at this time ( @2012-08-13)</p><h3>Details</h3><table class="grid"><tr><td style="display: none">-</td><td><b>Extension</b></td><td><b>Goal</b></td><td><b>Status</b></td><td><b>DoNotPerform</b></td><td><b>Scheduled[x]</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td style="display: none">*</td><td/><td><a href="#hcexample-careplan-multiple/goal-increase-energy-3">Goal: lifecycleStatus = active; description = </a></td><td>On Hold</td><td>false</td><td>2012-07-23 --&gt; (ongoing)</td><td>Eve will start using stretch bands and one step 2 days a week Mon/Wed 6-7am and maybe Friday afternoon</td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>activity</b></p><h3>Details</h3><table class="grid"><tr><td style="display: none">-</td><td